  there to help america come out of this  and see the other side  their objective is to gain full control  of new york and then use their newly  created city state as a base to create a  new world order  one where only those with strength of  will and character survive  both the true suns and the lmb have  quite a number of roles within their  ranks  their snipers tanks and heavy weapons  experts all have a military background  but where things start to differ is  where the true suns have spent a fair  amount of time bolstering their ranks  with civilians  and various professions with little  combat experience  on top of this due to a mutual agreement  with aaron kina a number of former  division agents turned rogue  have joined the lmb forces as squad  leaders or commanding officers  as stated earlier the last man battalion  is built up almost entirely of former  commandos from the army's elite  75th ranger regiment and the cia's  special operations group  these troops are among some of the most  highly trained soldiers in the world  where the true sons former jtf are  composed of not only national guard  and other military branches but police  officers  first responders and civil volunteers  also as their influence and territory  spread they conscripted a number of  inexperienced personnel into their ranks  like ex-cons cage fighters hunters  and engineers the trosons wield a number  of government-issued weapons  ranging from smgs assault rifles and  lmgs  to marksman rifles and shotguns  on top of this some of the x army  personnel have brought along rpgs  to add a bit more of a punch to their  output  engineers with backgrounds in  manufacturing and assembly provide  further support in the form of personal  turrets  of which they will put their life on the  line in order to keep them operational  but they aren't afraid to scavenge from  rival factions to add to the arsenal of  technology and have a wide range of  military and homemade equipment  although not always the case with  private military companies the last man  battalion have spared no expense  in equipping their troops with the  latest and greatest weapons and military  gear  they are far more heavily armed than  even the most well-funded military corps  and this is only further supported by  the rogue division agents who provide  field support  and the advanced shd tech and weaponry  with the lmb engineers and their  experience in engineering and robotics  they've been able to reverse engineer a  number of pieces of shd technology  and bring it over to their side  the trusons rely on suppression tactics  and snipers to pick targets off from  range  but alternatively they also utilize riot  foam and shotguns  to slow threats down and eliminate from  close quarters  their snipers are methodical and know  how to effectively use cover  throwers will try to keep their distance  in combat and although inexperienced  they are well aware of the damage they  can inflict  russia's charge into combat exposed and  vulnerable  but they fight for honor and are more  than happy to die as heroes  their tanks use this size to intimidate  their enemies they maintain a strict  workout routine  in order to withstand the heavy armor  they wear for extended periods of time  but they aren't used to being stood up  to and are easily disoriented when  attacked head-on  alien b riflemen make up the bulk of  their forces they use assault rifles and  flashbang or stun grenades  they are well trained and should be  watched at all times as they are  constantly trying to flank enemies while  they're distracted  the lmb snipers are powerful and  accurate any threats caught out in the  open will quickly be downed  yet staying in the cover isn't the  answer either the l b scouts are fast  and will rush straight towards the enemy  with their semi-automatic shotguns  and if they fail there are the  grenadiers with grenade launchers  and heavy gunners laying down  suppressive fire from a medium range  on top of this they have medics with  powerful healing support stations  which will quickly undo any progress  made by the opposing force of lift  uncheck  and then there are the first wave rogue  agents who are deadly at all ranges  and utilize a number of shd tech to  further tip the battle in the lmb's  favor  the true sons are a group made up of a  mix between well-trained ex-military  personnel  police firefighters and other civilians  who have been absorbed into their ranks  while on paper that seems relatively  messy they more than make up for this in  their discipline  and overall coordination their leader  antoine ridgeway built a standard for  his troops that included consistent  military training  to keep them on track and battlefit  although their methods of recruiting  have led to a quality of member who was  prone to questionable acts of cruelty  and lethal punishment on the local  populace over time this has turned the  true sons into vicious and arrogant  bullies  intimidation and violence have become a  way of life for those in their area of  influence  they have no problems making examples  out of individuals to ensure obedience  then we have the last man battalion a  private military company consisting of  highly trained  former united states special forces  after the dollar flew struck new york  the lmb were brought back into the  country  to assist the wealthy they've returned  from conflict zones overseas  and they aren't particularly happy with  being thrown into the centre of where  the epidemic first started  compared to other factions in the  manhattan quarantine zones  the lmb had far more combat specialists  with top grade military gear and weapons  and their defensive positions were more  heavily fortified  after they were then abandoned by the  jtf they took it upon themselves to  correct the horrible job that the  government was doing  using their own form of strict martial  law they are prepared to use all means  necessary  to ensure that the city and then the  country survives these events  [Music]  although these two groups have a very  strong resemblance in their reasons  behind turning against the government  and even their methods of doing so are  relatively comparable to a certain  extent  this is where the similarities end based  on the points covered earlier on  the outcome here is fairly clear-cut and  one-sided  even if we remove the fact that they  have keen as rogue agents within their  ranks  the last man battalion out-does the true  sons in almost every scenario  from their training and background to  the weapons and technology  all the way through to their discipline  and loyalty  the only area where the true suns seem  to come out on top is through their  numbers  but even then past the initial uprising  of the jtf  most of these are convicts and general  civilians who have been forced to fall  in line  the fact that the lmb are a pmc who up  until recently were overseas in conflict  areas  only further supports how much more  prepared they are for the situation  they're in  we're the true sons a former jtf and we  know how well they've been doing  throughout all of this  if we were to heavily generalize private  military companies  they're also more used to being disliked  by the general population  and although this isn't always the case  with all of them pmcs are often more  heavily armed than general military  personnel  and probably one of the main things to  consider is that when pmcs are on  assignment  they are constantly under threat there  is no off time for them  where a soldier can return to a heavily  defended military camp when off duty  pmcs need to be prepared and ready at  all times  although they both have the same  motivations and roughly the same  techniques of achieving their goals  the l b really are on a different level  from the true suns  so with that in mind what would happen  hypothetically if we were to put them up  against another pmc  the black t